    corner reads soft and hand-cut. Generated by art/icons.py (edit the script, not the lines between the ICONS markers); each
    Geometry is even-odd ("F0"): a subpath inside another punches a hole.
    Menu item icons are the theme's own PNG set (art/menu-icons.json, docs/themes/menu-icons.md).
-->
